Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Concrete TickPipelineReplayAdapter backed by a live ServerLevel. Provides:
- computeStateHash(): walks chunks/BEs/entities/globals through canonical
  save paths, feeds into StateHashComputer with deterministic ordering.
- inputToTasks(): emits one GLOBAL_RW placeholder TaskNode per player who
  has packets this tick. Player IDs sorted for replay determinism. The
  task is a logging no-op — full NMS packet decoding (byte[] → structured
  task with precise RWSet) remains a separate workstream tracked in
  NEBULA_BLOCKERS.md.

Also commits NebulaStressMode helper which gates stress-spawn DAG path.

